      "writtenOn": "2022-09-08T10:58:15Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Can we move this code to makeSkDestroyListener(), makeSkDestroyListener() will return null or a new instance by depending on the \"bpfNetMaps\" value, then here we can just say:\n\n```\nmSkDestroyListener \u003d mDeps.makeSkDestroyListener(mCookieTagMap, mHandler);\nmHandler.post(mSkDestroyListener::start);\n```",
